# Generated by `next dev` (Next 16 agentRules). Build output, not source.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Generated by Next on every dev/build. Its contents differ between the two —
# `.next/dev/types/...` after `next dev`, `.next/types/...` after `next build` —
# so tracking it means the tree goes dirty depending on which command ran last.
# It stays in tsconfig's `include`; Next regenerates it locally as needed.
next-env.d.ts

